FastGeSCF includes project-specific code plus vendored third-party code.

Project-specific changes are provided for research use. Vendored components keep their original licenses:

- SAM2-derived files under `sam2/` follow the upstream SAM2 Apache-2.0 license from Meta Platforms, Inc.
- LightGlue is an external dependency from https://github.com/cvg/LightGlue and is not distributed in this repository.
- SALAD files under `salad/` follow `salad/LICENSE`.
- Utility files under `py_utils/` follow `py_utils/LICENSE`.

See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for details.
